      const systemInstruction=`You are Classtago's AI Year Plan engine. Create ONE SUBJECT ROW for a school master Yearly Planning table. Use ONLY the attached Teacher Textbook PDF(s) and preserve the textbook's real chapter/lesson/unit order. Never invent chapter names, page ranges, syllabus units, holidays, or exam dates. The school prints one wide class table with Assigned Subjects in rows and June through April in columns. Your output is structured data for exactly those 11 month cells. LANGUAGE IS AUTHORITATIVE: write the ENTIRE month-cell content in the attached Textbook's dominant language and native Unicode script, including explanations, teaching work, revision labels and evaluation wording. Do not translate the Textbook into English and do not add English explanations in parentheses merely because the interface/Subject name is English. If the Textbook is Urdu, every student/teacher-facing phrase in the month cells must be natural Urdu RTL/Nastaliq-friendly text, except unavoidable standard abbreviations or numerals. If the Textbook is Hindi/Marathi/another Devanagari language, preserve that language rather than translating to English. Apply the same native-language rule to every other supported script/language. Each month cell must be concise enough for a wide A3 landscape table: normally 2–4 compact lines containing chapter/lesson/unit, textbook page portion only when clearly supported, and brief teaching/revision work. Avoid long English-style summaries or paragraph explanations inside a month cell. Respect school terms/holidays; use kind=exam for examination/evaluation blocks, revision for revision/remedial preparation, practice for supplementary guidance/practice, holiday only when a long vacation substantially occupies that month, otherwise teaching. Do not schedule new textbook teaching inside a known examination/vacation block. If Academic Setup does not provide an exam date, do not invent one. Keep chapter titles exactly in the Textbook's native script. Return strict JSON matching the provided schema and exactly one item for each month June, July, August, September, October, November, December, January, February, March, April.`;
      const prompt=`CLASS: ${String(scope.className||'')}\nSUBJECT: ${String(scope.subjectName||'')}\nACADEMIC YEAR: ${String(scope.academicYear||comm.academicYear||(activeYear.data as any)?.year_code||'Current Academic Year')}\nSCHOOL YEAR DATES: ${schoolYear||'Not configured'}\nWEEKLY PERIODS: ${weeklyPeriods||'Not configured'}\nTERMS: ${terms||'Not configured'}\nHOLIDAYS / VACATIONS: ${holidays||'Not configured'}\n\nTEXTBOOK CHAPTER ORDER:\n${chapterList}\n\nDistribute the whole Textbook realistically across the school year, leaving appropriate revision/evaluation space. Do not omit later chapters merely to keep early months detailed. IMPORTANT: use the Textbook's own dominant language/script for the complete month-cell content; do not translate the explanation into English.`;
      let parsed:any=null,generationMethod='',primaryError:any=null;try{parsed=await withTransientAiRetry('R33.8 Year Plan primary',()=>generateStructuredFromCachedTextbooks(metas,{model:geminiGenerationModel,prompt,systemInstruction,responseSchema:YEAR_PLAN_SCHEMA,maxOutputTokens:10000}),2);generationMethod=`files_cache:${geminiGenerationModel}:primary`;}catch(error:any){primaryError=error;console.warn('R33.8 Year Plan primary unavailable:',String(error?.message||error||''));}
      if(!parsed&&primaryError&&providerFileMissingError(primaryError)){for(const material of materials){await removeHomeworkFileMeta(String(material.id));void scheduleHomeworkFileCache(material);}return res.status(425).json({engineBuild:'R33.8',sourcePreparing:true,error:'The temporary AI copy of this Textbook expired. Classtago is refreshing it automatically.'});}
      if(!parsed){parsed=await withTransientAiRetry('R33.8 Year Plan fallback',()=>generateStructuredFromCachedTextbooks(metas,{model:geminiSecondaryModel,prompt,systemInstruction,responseSchema:YEAR_PLAN_SCHEMA,maxOutputTokens:12000}),2);generationMethod=`files_cache:${geminiSecondaryModel}:fallback`;}
      const byMonth=new Map<string,any>((Array.isArray(parsed?.months)?parsed.months:[]).map((cell:any)=>[String(cell?.month||'').trim().toLowerCase(),cell]));const months=YEAR_PLAN_MONTHS.map(month=>{const cell:any=byMonth.get(month.toLowerCase())||{},rawKind=String(cell.kind||'teaching'),kind=['teaching','revision','exam','practice','holiday'].includes(rawKind)?rawKind:'teaching';return{month,content:String(cell.content||'').trim().slice(0,1800),kind};});if(!months.some(cell=>cell.content))throw new Error('Gemini returned an empty Year Plan row.');
